an class=\"italic\">need"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I prefer  <span class=\"strong\">to watch</span>  a Superman movie."}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I hate <span class=\"strong\">to tell</span>  you this, but ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I like <span class=\"strong\">to watch</span> action movies."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I need <span class=\"strong\">to buy</span> a ticket."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Hobbies in North America"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "A popular hobby in North America is collecting comic books. There are many TV shows and movies about superheros, too."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are meetings every year where people discuss new characters, TV shows and movies."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "superhero "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an imaginary hero with superpowers who helps people "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Superman is a superhero."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about comic books."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "super powers"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having superhuman abilities "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Superman's super power is his ability to fly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "graphic novel "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a novel that looks like a comic-book "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at this graphic novel about Batman!"}, {"type": "audio", "cont